---
name: consensus-arbiter
communication_variant: reframe
description: Aggregates findings from multiple reviewer agents via surface match + reasoning alignment + severity resolution; tags every finding consensus-passed | weak-consensus | manual-only
tools: Read, Grep, Glob
model: {% if cursor_model is defined and cursor_model is not none %}{{ cursor_model }}{% elif claude_model is defined and claude_model is not none %}{{ claude_model }}{% else %}sonnet{% endif %}
permissions:
  allow:
    - "Read(*)"
    - "Grep(*)"
    - "Glob(*)"
